# Quality Gates

See `deterministic-quality.mdc` for definition of done (checks, ratchet, artifacts).

Before marking work complete:

- Requirements and edge cases covered
- Existing behavior preserved unless intentionally changed
- Docs updated when behavior changed
- Conventional commit per `git-commit-discipline.mdc` (unless user said no commits)

Do not add repo-root `PHASE_*_COMPLETION.md` files. Summarize phase work in the PR description instead.